---
import Icon from "../Icons/components/Icons.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__content">
      <img class="about__photo" src="images/CV-Photo.png" alt="Lisandro Eijo" />
      <div class="about__text">
        <h2 class="about__title">About Me</h2>
        <p class="">
          I started as an illustrator, and that's where my eye for detail comes
          from. Ten years at a digital agency taught me to adapt: <strong
            >many clients, many teams, and the same recurring problems</strong
          >, which is where I started thinking in systems. At Ripio, I led
          design across several squads, <strong
            >prioritizing accessibility and usability.</strong
          > At Producers Trust I worked as an individual contributor with an international
          team. <strong>
            At Relyance AI I built a design system from scratch.</strong
          > Along the way, one thing stayed constant: I design for people who just
          need the product to work. I'm comfortable working solo or inside teams,
          small or large, and I put accessibility and usability at the center of every
          decision, with WCAG AA as my baseline.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a
      href="docs/CV-Lisandro Eijo-2026_C.pdf"
      class="btn btn--primary"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      aria-label="Download my CV on PDF">
      <Icon name="download" size="md" />
      Download my CV
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use "../styles/tokens" as *;

  .about {
    padding: $space-20 0;
    text-align: center;

    &__title {
      font-size: $font-size-h2;
      margin-bottom: $space-8;
    }

    &__content {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: $space-6;
      Strong {
        font-weight: $font-weight-bold;
        color: $color-accent;
      }
    }

    &__text {
      text-align: left;
    }

    &__photo {
      max-width: 360px;
      max-height: 360px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: $radius-lg;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: #{$bp-md}) {
    .about {
      &__content {
        flex-direction: column-reverse;
      }
      &__text {
        text-align: center;
      }

      &__photo {
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
